    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monad Tachyon</i> is a high-speed Metroidvania game where you can experience action that breaks the sound barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world teeming with strange insect creatures. Guided by a mysterious silver-haired girl, you embark on an unknown journey into the depths of this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting, fast-paced action with simple controls:</strong> Accumulate acceleration to increase your attack power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique story and cutscenes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Metroidvania exploration</strong></p></li></ul>",
